{"name": "Palace of a Thousand Curses", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"374\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330540/extras/b6af9e13514380eaba17596a12e3cb2a.avif?t=1773923916\" width=\"800\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Leap into a 2.5D action platformer that takes inspiration from the iconic gameplay of the old-school <i>Prince of Persia</i> games, but upgrades it with a unique swashbuckling combat system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Keep your wits as sharp as your blade, for only the most heroic, dashing, and (most importantly) <i>stylish</i> of swordmasters will make it out alive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"97\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330540/extras/ac05036fb7a6b08afd91d84843ec3b7c.avif?t=1773923916\" width=\"800\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"282\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330540/extras/a0fe284b90d94e03bb69b456cc5c489c.poster.avif?t=1773923916\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330540/extras/a0fe284b90d94e03bb69b456cc5c489c.webm?t=1773923916\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330540/extras/a0fe284b90d94e03bb69b456cc5c489c.mp4?t=1773923916\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Earn style by fighting with flair - swing from chandeliers, trick enemies into attacking each other, kick bottles into your enemies, and any other clever maneuvers you can find. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Then use your Style to dazzle your enemies with powerful special abilities, turning the tables on even the most powerful foes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"97\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330540/extras/3f99d5f546ef38486225d9db89b476b0.avif?t=1773923916\" width=\"800\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"282\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330540/extras/5b18d98284561ec26c72864fa38cbcf5.poster.avif?t=1773923916\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330540/extras/5b18d98284561ec26c72864fa38cbcf5.webm?t=1773923916\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330540/extras/5b18d98284561ec26c72864fa38cbcf5.mp4?t=1773923916\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each level is designed to encourage exploration, with mysterious secrets hidden throughout. Paths are interwoven, and every twist and turn can reveal either a marvelous new surprise... or a deadly trap.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"97\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330540/extras/d8e5b9c64d97ae5d56b4a57b8c927e16.avif?t=1773923916\" width=\"800\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"282\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330540/extras/4374d02d9004f3a1f850aafd03e8f88d.poster.avif?t=1773923916\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330540/extras/4374d02d9004f3a1f850aafd03e8f88d.webm?t=1773923916\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330540/extras/4374d02d9004f3a1f850aafd03e8f88d.mp4?t=1773923916\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every room of the Palace is a handcrafted work of art, but the dangers within will change each time you fail. You must stay on your toes if you are to survive its perils!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"97\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330540/extras/bfea49756cde3b117aa7e436e1053e56.avif?t=1773923916\" width=\"800\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"282\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330540/extras/fffa571944f91df37e0bb9d87de21a95.poster.avif?t=1773923916\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330540/extras/fffa571944f91df37e0bb9d87de21a95.webm?t=1773923916\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330540/extras/fffa571944f91df37e0bb9d87de21a95.mp4?t=1773923916\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are Rodrigo Al-Ahzab, a lowly beggar whose only aim is to survive in the streets of Granada. When you are pulled into a magical book, you learn that there are things that matter to you even more than your own survival\u2026\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Created by one of the writers behind <i>SpecOps: The Line</i>, this is a story with depths hidden behind the simple facade... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Parry and thrust your way into a 2.5D action platformer with a unique style-based combat system. As you explore hidden passageways and duel strange creatures, you will need all of your swashbuckling panache to survive.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330540/header.jpg?t=1773923916", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Swordplay", "Side Scroller", "Exploration", "2D Platformer", "Metroidvania", "Combat"], "developers": "Scruffy Dog Games", "publishers": "Scruffy Dog Games", "release_date": "To be announced", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "3330540", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "16 August 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/oY7Z53JFH74", "first_seen": 1787672579.555697}